   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 09 · Qwen-Image 2.1 — fix a picture with one sentence\n**Use:** load the picture → write the **instruction** (what changes + \"keep … unchanged\") → Run → `S5/edit_q21_*.png`.\n8 steps, cfg 1 (Turbo schedule). **Measured (local 5070 Ti, 2026-10-26):** 11 s incl. model load (928×1152).\n\n| Knob | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| instruction | one change per run; name what must stay (\"keep her face, hair and pose unchanged\") |\n| 2nd reference | adds the second Load Image as `<image2>` (a garment, an object to insert) |\n| new canvas size | **outpaint / change the aspect**: the picture stays the reference, the output gets width × height (16:9 = 1536×864, 9:16 = 864×1536). Write \"Show more of the scene to the left and right.\" |\n\n**Which tool for which fix (series 5):**\n| Fix | Use | Why (series 5, same test set) |\n|---|---|---|\n| remove an object | **09_edit_qwen21** | every bike gone, scene kept; Krea Turbo left a distant bike |\n| recolour | 09_edit_qwen21 or 09_edit_krea_general | all models pass; Krea keeps the original look softer |\n| relight | **09_edit_krea_general** | warm light, person kept; Qwen-Edit 2511 repaints the face |\n| background swap | **09_edit_qwen21** | clean new place; Krea keeps leftovers (tram rails) |\n| fix a hand | **09_edit_qwen21** (whole frame) | coherent grip; Krea ignores it; 2511 crop adds tools |\n| outpaint / new aspect | **09_edit_qwen21**, toggle *new canvas size* | grey-pad + fill fails on most models |\n| head swap (last resort) | **09_edit_headswap_bfs** | BFS on Qwen 2.1 keeps the target's expression + light |"
   ]
  },
